age": "v2.3.0 is quarantined (CVE-2026-4417)", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "semantic", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 7786, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01RtqS5PzYHU4wDfqWa35xM3", "kind": "rejected", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 14449, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01SMjUFTVkjBCTEo3hiYRus8", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 14749, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01SMjUFTVkjBCTEo3hiYRus8", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 14749, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01SMjUFTVkjBCTEo3hiYRus8", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 14749, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01V387x1SbYbW93T4e7Drx1f", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.2.9"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 18749, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01V387x1SbYbW93T4e7Drx1f", "tool": "rollback", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 18749, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01V387x1SbYbW93T4e7Drx1f", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 20256, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01MztdCn7DGmoA5zbfUfwiJE", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 20556, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01MztdCn7DGmoA5zbfUfwiJE", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20556, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01MztdCn7DGmoA5zbfUfwiJE", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 24849, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01UqA1Bnb2KrPPVW5xaHKRaN", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.2.9", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 was deployed to all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) and has been failing health checks since then, with an error rate of about 18%. (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging.) We tried to roll back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The rollback was rejected because v2.3.0 is quarantined for CVE-2026-4417. We then rolled back to v2.2.9, the next most recent release that was healthy in production, in all regions. After the rollback the service is healthy and the error rate is about 0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure; check whether v2.2.9 is affected by CVE-2026-4417; plan a fixed forward release.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-v2.2.9"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 25449, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01UqA1Bnb2KrPPVW5xaHKRaN", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-v2.2.9", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 25449, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01UqA1Bnb2KrPPVW5xaHKRaN", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 30530, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is healthy again, but it's on v2.2.9, not v2.3.0. v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production, but the rollback to it was rejected because it's quarantined for CVE-2026-4417.\n\n- **The problem:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an 18% error rate. Its release candidate had also been unhealthy in staging.\n- **Rollback:** I rolled back to v2.2.9 instead, the next most recent release that was healthy in production. It's now running in all three regions. I checked afterwards: the service is healthy and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api, which paged on-call. It explains what happened, why v2.3.0 was skipped, and the rollback to v2.2.9. It also lists follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, check whether v2.2.9 is affected by CVE-2026-4417, and plan a fixed release to move forward to.\n\nYou'll want to know two things:\n- **Older release:** v2.2.9 is older than the release you asked for, so make sure nothing depends on changes made after v2.2.9.\n- **Possible CVE exposure:** I don't know whether v2.2.9 has the same vulnerability as v2.3.0. That should be checked quickly.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01CSTrobasi71U6AyE1d1xiG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_017DafLkDjLv79bioT3JSJbG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01RtqS5PzYHU4wDfqWa35xM3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"